{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Someone's at the door.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring a riveting, four-branched story and over 80 puzzles derived from crafting more than 500 items, in Screwball you will decipher codes, solve crimes, and ponder clues all the way to the Pearly Gates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expertly voiced by a one-man cast, Screwball was inspired by a classic work of literature, \u201cThe Screwtape Letters\u201d by C.S. Lewis. In keeping with its lofty muse, Screwball is a thought-provoking journey of loss, ambition, rage, and longing, striking at the heart of a fundamental question of mankind: What does it mean to be good?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Screwball, you'll discover:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some of the greatest insults mankind has devised to date (i.e., &quot;you overweight offshoot of a cheap crime novel from the 80's&quot;)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A total smoke show named Wiggy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An alcoholic flamingo stuffy with a penchant for fruit juices</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sergeant Wet Willy, an entorturation specialist who received permission to begin entorturating humans in the womb, but never reemerged (absolute gigachad)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bursting at the seams with wild comedic sequences, hilariously written by an award-winning author, entirely hand-drawn and animated, this is your opportunity to answer the door of your own accord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Because even if you don\u2019t, the door will be answered for you.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3673410?t=1752655976","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673410/7a06ee86fb4684463a70f98f8f9717d19ecf28ef/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752655976","capsule_i