ant for fruit juices</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sergeant Wet Willy, an entorturation specialist who received permission to begin entorturating humans in the womb, but never reemerged (absolute gigachad)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bursting at the seams with wild comedic sequences, hilariously written by an award-winning author, entirely hand-drawn and animated, this is your opportunity to answer the door of your own accord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Because even if you don\u2019t, the door will be answered for you.</strong></p>","developers":["Scott Tipton"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673410/1abec72451eceec2239c9f60b03f762f7a3bd0c9/header.jpg?t=1752655976","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257167794,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257167794/movie480.mp4?t=1752655974","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257167794/movie_max.mp4?t=1752655974"},"name":"Screwball Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257167794/c01398b0523cadaad8ee1282a1ee740c6cb7746d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752655974","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257167794/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752655974"